#### HTTP/3监听器
```yaml
- name: http3_listener
  address:
    socket_address: { address: 0.0.0.0, port_value: 443 }
  listener_filters:
  - name: envoy.filters.listener.tls_inspector
    typed_config:
      "@type": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.listener.tls_inspector.v3.TlsInspector
  filter_chains:
  - filter_chain_match:
      application_protocols: ["h3"]
    transport_socket:
      name: envoy.transport_sockets.quic
      typed_config:
        "@type": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.transport_sockets.quic.v3.QuicDownstreamTransport
        downstream_tls_context:
          common_tls_context:
            tls_certificates:
            - certificate_chain: { filename: "/path/to/cert.pem" }
              private_key: { filename: "/path/to/key.pem" }
    filters:
    - name: envoy.filters.network.http_connection_manager
      typed_config:
        "@type": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.network.http_connection_manager.v3.HttpConnectionManager
        stat_prefix: h3_proxy
        codec_type: HTTP3
        route_config:
          name: local_route
          virtual_hosts:
          - name: backend
            domains: ["*"]
            routes:
            - match: { prefix: "/" }
              route: { cluster: http3_cluster }
        http_filters:
        - name: envoy.filters.http.router
          typed_config:
            "@type": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.router.v3.Router
```
- 监听HTTPS/H3连接（端口443）
- 使用TLS检查器识别HTTP/3流量
- 通过QUIC协议处理HTTP/3流量
- 需要配置TLS证书和私钥
- 使用HTTP连接管理器处理HTTP请求
- 路由所有请求到 `http3_cluster` 集群

### 2.2 集群配置 (clusters)

#### TCP集群
```yaml
- name: tcp_cluster
  connect_timeout: 0.25s
  type: STATIC
  lb_policy: ROUND_ROBIN
  load_assignment:
    cluster_name: tcp_cluster
    endpoints:
    - lb_endpoints:
      - endpoint:
          address:
            socket_address: { address: 192.168.1.100, port_value: 8080 }
```
- 名称为 `tcp_cluster`
- 连接超时时间为0.25秒
- 使用静态服务发现
- 负载均衡策略为轮询
- 后端服务器地址为 192.168.1.100:8080

#### UDP集群
```yaml
