  connect_timeout: 0.25s
  type: STATIC
  lb_policy: MAGLEV
  load_assignment:
    cluster_name: udp_cluster
    endpoints:
    - lb_endpoints:
      - endpoint:
          address:
            socket_address: { address: 192.168.1.101, port_value: 53, protocol: UDP }
```
- 使用Maglev哈希负载均衡算法（适合UDP）
- 后端服务器为 192.168.1.101:53 (DNS服务器)

